{"id":"07a2068e17b51af1198586a2de25927ab1d166c2","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1248678","title":"10 年开发，北京 WLB 极佳但薪资 20k，苟到被 AI 完全替代直接回老家退休，可行吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"remix7","excerpt":"职场话题 - @remix7 - 地点与年限：北京，10 年开发经验，主要是偏前端，后端也能做一点。公司情况：一家垂直行业的私企，最近刚刚完成了 _ 轮融资(具体不说了)。合同与稳定性：入职 3 年多，期间一直没有涨过","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/remix7\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/220b/d29a/527117_xlarge.png?m=1791950137\" width=\"73\" alt=\"remix7\" data-uid=\"527117\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/remix7\">remix7</a> · <span title=\"2026-10-14 12:03:11 +08:00\">19h 38m ago</span> · 1701 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>地点与年限：北京，10 年开发经验，主要是偏前端，后端也能做一点。</p>\n<p>公司情况：一家垂直行业的私企，最近刚刚完成了 _ 轮融资(具体不说了)。</p>\n<p>合同与稳定性：入职 3 年多，期间一直没有涨过薪，不过最近刚顺利续签了合同。</p>\n<p>薪资待遇：工资 + 各类补贴，税前总共 22k 。</p>\n<p>工作节奏：完全不加班，每天 6 点准时走人。</p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/北京\"><li></li> 北京</a><a href=\"/tag/开发\"><li></li> 开发</a><a href=\"/tag/薪资\"><li></li> 薪资</a></P><p><span>8 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-14 17:32:33 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18178684\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/117e03f151006cb9f7751d48322e3311?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaoba25\" data-uid=\"349618\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaoba25\">xiaoba25</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-14 12:05:24 +08:00\">19h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>苟着吧 现在整体就业市场萎缩比较厉害 工资什么的都不是核心了 刚融资 没什么问题的话再做 2 年是问题不大的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18178714\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/db0384a502ffe1446651955a6c62c131?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tjfamtf\" data-uid=\"677507\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tjfamtf\">tjfamtf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-14 12:13:13 +08:00\">19h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可行感觉，现在北京出来前端基本上找不到工作了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18178716\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a70b/af1a/162014_normal.png?m=1691056330\" alt=\"whyrookie\" data-uid=\"162014\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/whyrookie\">whyrookie</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-14 12:13:37 +08:00\">19h 28m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>和我几乎一样的情况，只是我没在北京，有时候心有不甘为，感觉自己做事情还算靠谱，有时侯又觉得不加班继续苟着吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18179579\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b72b38177b4acd171153710dc75f40ac?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"AlexJ8175\" data-uid=\"655918\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AlexJ8175\">AlexJ8175</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-14 14:57:35 +08:00\">16h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>听着和我的前司挺